  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/348126/Spheres-Apocrypha-Radiant-and-Righteous?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Radiant and Righteous</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Alteration sphere (Outsider Body), Guardian sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use your patrol ability, you may apply the benefits of this feat as a (zone) talent. Your allies within your threatened area gain a chosen trait from the Outsider Body talent whose subtype matches an alignment you possess. Additionally, enemies within your threatened area which possess an alignment opposed to the subtype of the chosen trait take 1d6 additional damage matching your chosen trait’s subtype from your allies benefiting from this feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc72\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
